{"product_id":"hat-mount","title":"M-Series Hat Mount","description":"\u003cp class=\"p1\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"s1\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eM-Series Hat Mounts are designed for comfort and versatility. They fit most baseball caps, visors, and safety bump caps providing a stable mounting for M-Series Smart Glasses. They can hold several M-Series On-Frame Battery types on one side and a single custom Vuzix rail mount on the other. The mounts rotate 360 degrees allowing use of M-Series Smart Glasses with either the left or right eye.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Vuzix","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":43111750434982,"sku":"446T0A038","price":19.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0581\/1208\/2086\/products\/ScreenShot2022-07-15at10.17.52AM.png?v=1657898381","url":"https:\/\/www.vuzix.com\/products\/hat-mount","provider":"Vuzix Corporation","version":"1.0","type":"link"}